<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">EADA General</h1>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">*Note: The reporting period must be 12 months. The dates for the reporting year should be consistent from year to year.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>
      <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Begins:</label>
      <input type="text" value="{{ eada_general.begins_date }}" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    </div>
    <div>
      <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Ends:</label>
      <input type="text" value="{{ eada_general.ends_date }}" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Number of Full-time Undergraduates by Gender</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">The numbers below were reported on your institution's {{ reporting_year }}-21 IPEDS Survey and should not be changed unless they were reported incorrectly to IPEDS. The numbers indicate the full-time certificate or degree-seeking total. If the numbers are incorrect, please call the EADA Help Desk.</p>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
        <th style="padding: 10px; text-align: left;"></th>
        <th style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">Number</th>
        <th style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">Percent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <td style="padding: 10px;">Male full-time undergraduates</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.male_undergraduates }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.male_percent }}%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;">
        <td style="padding: 10px;">Female full-time undergraduates</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.female_undergraduates }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.female_percent }}%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
        <td style="padding: 10px;">Total full-time undergraduates</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.total_undergraduates }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">{{ eada_general.total_percent }}%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Athletic Sanctioning Body for the Designated Reporting Year (select one):</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px;">
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NCAA Division I-FBS"> NCAA Division I-FBS</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NAIA Division I"> NAIA Division I</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="CCCAA"> CCCAA</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NCAA Division I-FCS"> NCAA Division I-FCS</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NAIA Division II"> NAIA Division II</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NWAC"> NWAC</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NCAA Division I without football"> NCAA Division I without football</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NJCAA Division I"> NJCAA Division I</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="USCAA"> USCAA</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NCAA Division II with football"> NCAA Division II with football</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NJCAA Division II"> NJCAA Division II</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="Independent"> Independent</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NCAA Division II without"> NCAA Division II without</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="NJCAA Division III"> NJCAA Division III</label>
    <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><input type="radio" name="sanctioning_body" value="Other"> Other</label>
  </div>
</div>

